e was uniform.\n\nExact enumeration checked d=1,2,3,4: 4,24,60,112 histories and 3,18,45,84 distinct trees; every total variation was 1/6. Audit the rooted-versus-translation convention, vertex-versus-edge count, frontier cardinality, history multiplicities and complexity claim. This counterexample concerns this growth rule, not all possible efficient samplers.\n",
